    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 235 bags of the same presentation with a daily use of 13.4 bags, providing 17.6 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The current label for NDC 51662135203 names HF Acquisition Co LLC, DBA HealthFirst as the registered plant with a VAI inspection on 2025-06-26.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
