    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that plant (FEI 3014534) show a series of VAI classifications from 2008 through 2025.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from B. Braun Medical Inc., which is also not on FDA's shortage list today.",
